    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97bea9286de1a00eb98fd8f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "米浴是个对自己没有自信的赛马娘。\n这样的她有了期盼许久的训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecbb0d65f2c901a572103497b355f88932f7b02c07668f3ad29a682c0e38d086",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1030/storytimeline_501030400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5ae68d29628405b5c6b82db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "米浴决定透过这个机会，\n要从“没用的赛马娘”有所成长，\n变成一朵会带来幸福的“蓝蔷薇”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e1858ec61e73b2a09053ecffab9268573e0fbd0dab7931778ddca7884ca8f60",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1030/storytimeline_501030400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90a22c0515188af597ee0d1a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只是受到接踵而来的“不幸”影响，\n米浴在第一天的训练就大迟到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c8bf57ccdd0fe364878b4eb1846d66d2348dd8727fe266191ee5769f1f11b59",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1030/storytimeline_501030400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89f6344cb24935a8ec33578c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她本来想要自行弥补落后的部分，\n但训练员伸出手告诉她，要和她一起努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e340055b264a8fc52f34713a5f15e1b1c8447e94264559215c9047f03f64b3c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1030/storytimeline_501030400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0337ee890c0beac1a091ee98",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "米浴登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1fd140ff4134671f37d6723f23f155cab5bf0674941872c76bb23d5459da4c2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1030/storytimeline_501030400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f17e9dd3175c1be13ca45716",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
