      "uid": "zhcn:12a4f60e7037168cbebf9110",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“宝冢纪念”在阪神赛场举办的可能性\n微乎其微。米浴将一切归咎于\n自己的“不幸”而懊悔不已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e809ce76e940f544427a23773957550781bece28c97122cd9e95a69c0ca06cce",
