      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“春季S”当天──\n米浴对自己是否能够\n追上美浦波旁感到不安。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc9be12cf0dcf273a219c3b0ab9cf36c7a83d76705b2a64d863dc44209289194",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
