      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，她的挑战才刚开始。\n她转换心情，前去面对自己\n当作小试身手的首场竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f990364ca82b1d7853131e81324cc924d9798222a07af1e2d0723a09258dbb04",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
