      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“日本德比”当天。\n在一片热闹的会场中，\n大多是对美浦波旁抱持期待的欢呼声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cc4b459faf4a1eaf1b73ffa83fb06490e81f0a264a4ba010ff2493f416321a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
