      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员建议米浴，\n就算不是自己的主场，\n也别因此而有迷惘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e5d322c38a7115c108570984769534a68b8511be1b589a3957712d72a408356",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
