      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“天皇赏（春）”很快就要开始了。\n目白麦昆为了写下\n三连霸的辉煌纪录也会出赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "209f584a438db5dda439f9b5bd482ecbd7c3e0b9c7b9ec7f07d4c86950b120eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
