      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "米浴为了创造赢过她的“奇迹”，\n决心参赛挑战这个大舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac187620a11fa724278fc14a023b0cf2f25775e2453a12511561b426c9cd40b0",
